      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LESSISMORE (8) continued her good form when second last start at Wagga after overcoming a wide barrier for a win at that same venue at the previous appearance. May need luck at some stage extracting from the inside of the second row but is a big chance if things go her way. ELLENS DELIGHT (4) is in form and chasing the hat trick. Won her maiden two starts back at Canberra and was again impressive at her latest appearance at West Wyalong, leading from this barrier and scoring by 1.6 metres. Really delivering now and is capable of getting the job done again. MAGGIE MOTH (3) draws well and will be fitter for a respectable second when resuming at Parkes. THE TALK (9) is in the mix after finishing fourth from a similar barrier at Wagga last time out.",
